{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49876","headline":"忆江南 二 · 冯延巳","name":"忆江南 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"今日相逢花未发，正是去年，别离时节。\n东风次第有花开，恁时须约却重来。\n重来不怕花堪折，秪恐明年花发人离别。\n别离若向百花时，东风弹泪有谁知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"冯延巳","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49876.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49876","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}